/* TEST ONLY - do not install.
 *
 * Makes a new game start on chapter 4: copies chapter 4's ROM chapter-data entry
 * over chapter 0's entry. GetROMChapterStruct (0x08034618) returns
 * gChapterDataTable (ROM 0x088B0890, file offset $8B0890) + id * 0x94, so entry 0
 * is at file offset $8B0890. Ch4Entry.bin is chapter 4's 0x94 bytes from the clean
 * fe8.gba (copied by a script, verified byte-equal to entry 4 of the clean ROM).
 * Apply after Installer.event (or alone). Needs no hack installation include.
 */

PUSH
ORG $8B0890
#incbin "test/Ch4Entry.bin"
POP
